# ML Model API Integration - Walkthrough

## Summary
Integrated 2 ML models for plant monitoring in the Tumbuhkan backend:
- **Growth Detection (YOLO v8n)** - ESP32-CAM → API → Save to DB
- **Disease Detection (SSD+MobileNetV2)** - Flutter app → API → Response only

---

## Changes Made

### Database Schema
**[sensor.py](file:///d:/Semester%205/iot/tumbuhkan_backend/app/models/database/sensor.py)** - Added `growth_stage` column

```diff
+from sqlalchemy import Column, ..., String
+growth_stage = Column(String(50), nullable=True)
```

### Configuration
**[config.py](file:///d:/Semester%205/iot/tumbuhkan_backend/app/core/config.py)** - Added interval setting

```diff
+GROWTH_CAPTURE_INTERVAL_HOURS: int = 6
```

### ML Services
| File | Model | Purpose |
|------|-------|---------|
| [ml_service.py](file:///d:/Semester%205/iot/tumbuhkan_backend/app/services/ml_service.py) | YOLO v8n | Growth stage detection (4 classes) |
| [cv_service.py](file:///d:/Semester%205/iot/tumbuhkan_backend/app/services/cv_service.py) | SSD+MobileNetV2 | Disease detection (7 classes) |

### API Endpoints
**[prediction.py](file:///d:/Semester%205/iot/tumbuhkan_backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/prediction.py)**

| Endpoint | Method | Input | Output | DB Save |
|----------|--------|-------|--------|---------|
| `/api/v1/prediction/growth/detect` | POST | File upload | Growth stage + confidence | ✅ Yes |
| `/api/v1/prediction/growth/detect/base64` | POST | Base64 JSON | Growth stage + confidence | ✅ Yes |
| `/api/v1/prediction/disease/detect` | POST | File upload | Disease + recommendations | ❌ No |
| `/api/v1/prediction/status` | GET | - | Model status | - |

---

## Growth Stage Classes
1. Stage 01: Early Growth
2. Stage 02: Leafy Growth
3. Stage 03: Head Formation
4. Stage 04: Harvest Stage

## Disease Classes
- Bacterial
- Downy mildew on lettuce
- Powdery mildew on lettuce
- Septoria Blight on lettuce
- Viral
- Wilt and leaf blight on lettuce
- Healthy

---

## Verification Results
- ✅ YOLO v8n model loads successfully
- ✅ All API endpoints registered
- ✅ Dependencies installed (ultralytics, torch, torchvision, pillow, opencv-python)

## ESP32-CAM Usage Example
```cpp
// POST image to growth detection endpoint
HTTPClient http;
http.begin("http://YOUR_SERVER/api/v1/prediction/growth/detect");
http.addHeader("Content-Type", "multipart/form-data");
// Send camera frame as file upload
```

## Flutter Usage Example
```dart
// POST image to disease detection
final response = await http.MultipartRequest(
  'POST', 
  Uri.parse('$baseUrl/api/v1/prediction/disease/detect')
)..files.add(await http.MultipartFile.fromPath('file', imagePath));
```
